<http://data.silknow.org/object/8e28c0de-7fbb-3901-8da8-8d241e22c97f>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Flounce of blonde lace, made in Caen, France, 19th century"@en , "Deep crinoline flounce of black blonde lace, made with a more silky thread for the pattern, which is outlined with a glossy silk thread. The flowers and leaves are worked in cloth and half stitch with honeycomb fillings. It has a twist net ground. \n\nLarge flowers and leaves curve down to form the scalloped lower edge. Above them, diagonal trails of leaves and flowers extend across the remainder of the ground.\n\nThe lace is attached to a bobbin lace heading."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/0af58fdc-a297-33ee-b949-8ce5fbf77816> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Deep crinoline flounce of black blonde lace, made with a more silky thread for the pattern, which is outlined with a glossy silk thread. The flowers and leaves are worked in cloth and half stitch with honeycomb fillings. It has a twist net ground. \n\nLarge flowers and leaves curve down to form the scalloped lower edge. Above them, diagonal trails of leaves and flowers extend across the remainder of the ground.\n\nThe lace is attached to a bobbin lace heading."@en , "Flounce of blonde lace, made in Caen, France, 19th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/8e28c0de-7fbb-3901-8da8-8d241e22c97f/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/8e28c0de-7fbb-3901-8da8-8d241e22c97f/dimension/2> ;
